- there is currently no telephony/call-log integration available to Falcon for this flow;
- Falcon therefore records the Owner's own report of contact outcome and number of attempts as an attributable human follow-up record;
- the system must not present that report as independently verified call-log evidence;
- `OWNER_REPORTED_CONTACT_ATTEMPTS != TELEPHONY_VERIFIED_CALL_LOG`;
- `OWNER_REPORTED_CONTACT_RESULT != INDEPENDENT_COMMUNICATION_PROOF`;
- a future call-log/telephony integration may be considered later under separate planning/authority, but is not part of current planning truth;
